@base <https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/WONT/> .

<https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/WONT> rdf:type owl:Ontology ;
                                                     owl:imports <https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/MILD> ;
                                                     dcterms:description "A domain ontology of wounds, wound assessment, wound classification and wound treatment. WONT is the domain layer over the Mid Layer Disease Ontology (MILD): a wound is modelled as a MILD pathological disorder, and wound treatment, diagnosis and classification specialise the corresponding MILD processes and results."@en ;
                                                     dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> ;
                                                     dcterms:title "Wound Ontology"@en .

