                                                       ]
                                  ] ;
                  ns1:IAO_0000115 "A disease predisposition that inheres in a human being of advanced age and whose realization impairs wound healing."@en ;
                  rdfs:comment "Advanced age is a quality of the patient (PATO_0001764), not a disease. It is represented here as the predisposition it grounds, rather than by subsuming the PATO quality under a disease class."@en ;
                  rdfs:label "advanced age wound-healing predisposition"@en .


