                  rdfs:subClassOf wont:WONT_0000437 ;
                  ns1:IAO_0000115 "A burn classification grade that is a category of the burn wound classification according to Hildanus and Derganc."@en ;
                  rdfs:label "Burn wound classification grade according to Hildanus and Derganc"@en .


###  https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/WONT/WONT_0000504
